node-red-contrib-mcp-server (1.1.5+nrpath3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Remove node-ws, node-express, node-axios, node-uuid, node-eventsource
    from Depends: all directly or transitively require nodejs:any which
    conflicts with VitexSoftware node-red packaging.
    ws/express/axios are bundled by node-red; uuid/eventsource are now
    bundled via npm install into the package's own node_modules.
  * Keep node-cache Depends (vitexsoftware package, no nodejs:any chain).
  * Restore npm install build step for bundling uuid + eventsource.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 19 Jun 2026 17:00:00 +0200

node-red-contrib-mcp-server (1.1.5+nrpath2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Drop npm install / bundled node_modules: ws, express, axios are bundled
    by node-red; uuid and eventsource come from deb packages (already in
    Depends); node-cache from vitexsoftware repo.
  * Remove dh-nodejs from Build-Depends (no longer using --with nodejs).

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 19 Jun 2026 16:30:00 +0200

